{"unit_id":"MarvekG__deepseek-harness-model-config#card-zh","repo":"MarvekG/deepseek-harness-model-config","commit":"6355d9b30a1494a111ad02d721128c318f871073","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness 模型配置插件（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 Web 设置页增加模型高级配置，创建或编辑 llm-pi-ai 自定义端点及模型能力。它将页面注册到设置分区，并通过 Harness remotes 读取、修改设置和保存凭据。主要功能包括获取或手动添加模型、搜索和选择模型、从 models.dev 补全元数据，以及编辑上下文容量、输出上限、输入模态、推理等级和端点传输参数。适合需要在 Harness Web 中管理自定义模型服务的用户；抓取模型列表需填写端点 API Key，也可手动添加模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:1146-1232","src/client.js:1404-1483","src/client.js:1628-1847"]}
{"unit_id":"MarvekG__deepseek-harness-model-config#card-en","repo":"MarvekG/deepseek-harness-model-config","commit":"6355d9b30a1494a111ad02d721128c318f871073","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DeepSeek Harness Model Configuration Plugin (Web): adds a settings page for custom llm-pi-ai endpoints. Users can discover or add models, enrich metadata from models.dev, and edit model capacity, input modalities, and reasoning levels. Endpoint transport and retry options are also configurable.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:1146-1232","src/client.js:1404-1483","src/client.js:1628-1847"]}
