{"unit_id":"MarvekG__deepseek-harness-model-config#feature-feature-1","repo":"MarvekG/deepseek-harness-model-config","commit":"6355d9b30a1494a111ad02d721128c318f871073","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness 模型配置插件的功能「自定义端点管理」：在设置页新增或编辑 llm-pi-ai provider，填写名称、URL、协议及凭据，并可删除端点。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:1628-1800"]}
{"unit_id":"MarvekG__deepseek-harness-model-config#feature-feature-2","repo":"MarvekG/deepseek-harness-model-config","commit":"6355d9b30a1494a111ad02d721128c318f871073","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness 模型配置插件的功能「模型发现与选择」：通过模型发现接口获取候选项，支持搜索、全选、反选、取消全选和手动输入模型 ID，再选择要保存的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:1190-1270"]}
{"unit_id":"MarvekG__deepseek-harness-model-config#feature-feature-3","repo":"MarvekG/deepseek-harness-model-config","commit":"6355d9b30a1494a111ad02d721128c318f871073","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness 模型配置插件的功能「模型元数据补全」：拉取候选模型时查询 models.dev，为匹配项提供容量、输入模态和推理能力信息，并允许选择匹配记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:329-542"]}
{"unit_id":"MarvekG__deepseek-harness-model-config#feature-feature-4","repo":"MarvekG/deepseek-harness-model-config","commit":"6355d9b30a1494a111ad02d721128c318f871073","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness 模型配置插件的功能「逐模型能力编辑」：在模型条目中修改 ID、显示名称、上下文窗口、最大输出 token、文本或图像输入能力及 reasoningEfforts。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:1057-1145"]}
{"unit_id":"MarvekG__deepseek-harness-model-config#feature-feature-5","repo":"MarvekG/deepseek-harness-model-config","commit":"6355d9b30a1494a111ad02d721128c318f871073","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness 模型配置插件的功能「端点高级参数」：编辑 provider 默认容量、输入模态、推理兼容、缓存、传输、超时和重试设置，并将变更保存到 llm-pi-ai 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:821-1024"]}
{"unit_id":"MarvekG__deepseek-harness-model-config#feature-feature-6","repo":"MarvekG/deepseek-harness-model-config","commit":"6355d9b30a1494a111ad02d721128c318f871073","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness 模型配置插件的功能「保存端点配置」：确认后通过 settings remote 保存 provider 配置，并通过 credentials remote 单独写入 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:1404-1483"]}
{"unit_id":"MarvekG__deepseek-harness-model-config#caveat-1","repo":"MarvekG/deepseek-harness-model-config","commit":"6355d9b30a1494a111ad02d721128c318f871073","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness 模型配置插件在发现模型时会请求 models.dev 的公共元数据接口；端点结果在元数据不可用时仍可编辑。见 src/client.js:329-340、src/client.js:1190-1238。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:329-340","src/client.js:1190-1238"]}
{"unit_id":"MarvekG__deepseek-harness-model-config#caveat-2","repo":"MarvekG/deepseek-harness-model-config","commit":"6355d9b30a1494a111ad02d721128c318f871073","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"端点凭据经 Harness credentials remote 单独保存，配置预览只显示占位值。见 src/client.js:1218-1232、src/client.js:1404-1483。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:1218-1232","src/client.js:1404-1483"]}
